{"id":"e25523dc1eeba65a","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-boolean-restriction.md","title":"布尔函数的限制与固定自由变量数","display":"df-boolean-restriction — 布尔函数的限制与固定自由变量数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-boolean-restriction","aliases":["29-df-boolean-restriction"],"display":"df-boolean-restriction — 布尔函数的限制与固定自由变量数","depends_on":["[[29-df-bool-const]]"],"source_locator":"Section13.1, pp.203–204, DjVu scans218–219","source_basis":"原书文本层；扫描219原图核对限制集合记号。本地补全零变量、扩张及部分赋值编码。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-boolean-restriction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-boolean-restriction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-restriction — 布尔函数的限制与固定自由变量数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b9525166bc5de094\" href=\"?note=b9525166bc5de094\" title=\"29-df-bool-const\">29-df-bool-const</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Section13.1, pp.203–204, DjVu scans218–219"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书文本层；扫描219原图核对限制集合记号。本地补全零变量、扩张及部分赋值编码。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b9525166bc5de094\" href=\"?note=b9525166bc5de094\" title=\"29-df-bool-const\">29-df-bool-const</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star\\notin\\mathbb B\">\\(\\star\\notin\\mathbb B\\)</span> 是固定的额外符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(r\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对任意集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^J\">\\(\\mathbb B^J\\)</span> 是全部映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(J\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span> 的集合；函数限制、逆像和有限基数使用通常的集合论含义。</li>\n<li>下式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\to\\mathbb B\\cup\\{\\star\\}\">\\(\\rho:\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\to\\mathbb B\\cup\\{\\star\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb B^{\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}}\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(f:\\mathbb B^{\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}}\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y:\\rho^{-1}(\\{\\star\\})\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(y:\\rho^{-1}(\\{\\star\\})\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(J\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:J\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(a:J\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_n\">\\(\\operatorname{Ext}_n\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat a_n\">\\(\\widehat a_n\\)</span> 的输出是总映射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\!\\upharpoonright\\!\\rho\">\\(f\\!\\upharpoonright\\!\\rho\\)</span> 的输入仅在自由变量上取值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_n\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid1\\leq i\\leq n\\},\\qquad\\mathcal R_n\\coloneqq(\\mathbb B\\cup\\{\\star\\})^{V_n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_n\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid1\\leq i\\leq n\\},\\qquad\\mathcal R_n\\coloneqq(\\mathbb B\\cup\\{\\star\\})^{V_n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_n(\\rho)\\coloneqq\\rho^{-1}(\\{\\star\\}),\\qquad\\mathcal R_n^r\\coloneqq\\{\\rho\\in\\mathcal R_n\\mid|U_n(\\rho)|=r\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_n(\\rho)\\coloneqq\\rho^{-1}(\\{\\star\\}),\\qquad\\mathcal R_n^r\\coloneqq\\{\\rho\\in\\mathcal R_n\\mid|U_n(\\rho)|=r\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_n(\\rho,y)\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n},\\qquad\\operatorname{Ext}_n(\\rho,y)(i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}y(i),&amp;i\\in U_n(\\rho),\\\\\\rho(i),&amp;i\\in V_n\\setminus U_n(\\rho).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}_n(\\rho,y)\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n},\\qquad\\operatorname{Ext}_n(\\rho,y)(i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}y(i),&amp;i\\in U_n(\\rho),\\\\\\rho(i),&amp;i\\in V_n\\setminus U_n(\\rho).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\!\\upharpoonright\\!\\rho:\\mathbb B^{U_n(\\rho)}\\to\\mathbb B,\\qquad(f\\!\\upharpoonright\\!\\rho)(y)\\coloneqq f(\\operatorname{Ext}_n(\\rho,y)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\!\\upharpoonright\\!\\rho:\\mathbb B^{U_n(\\rho)}\\to\\mathbb B,\\qquad(f\\!\\upharpoonright\\!\\rho)(y)\\coloneqq f(\\operatorname{Ext}_n(\\rho,y)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat a_n\\in\\mathcal R_n,\\qquad\\widehat a_n(i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a(i),&amp;i\\in J,\\\\\\star,&amp;i\\in V_n\\setminus J.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat a_n\\in\\mathcal R_n,\\qquad\\widehat a_n(i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a(i),&amp;i\\in J,\\\\\\star,&amp;i\\in V_n\\setminus J.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书以变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\">\\(\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\\)</span> 表示限制；这里用索引集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_n\">\\(V_n\\)</span> 编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star\">\\(\\star\\)</span> 表示尚未赋值，而不是第三个布尔真值。限制后的函数有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 个输入，不能继续把被固定坐标当作它的参数。</p>\n<p>两个分段构造的分支分别划分 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_n\">\\(V_n\\)</span>，因此每个合法输入唯一产生指定值域中的总映射。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_n=\\varnothing\">\\(V_n=\\varnothing\\)</span>，限制集合含唯一空映射；零元布尔函数仍有一个输入，即空赋值。计数式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal R_n^r|=\\binom nr2^{n-r}\">\\(|\\mathcal R_n^r|=\\binom nr2^{n-r}\\)</span> 可直接由选择自由坐标及其余坐标的布尔值得到。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-bool-const","status":"resolved","id":"b9525166bc5de094","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bool-const]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bool-const","status":"resolved","id":"b9525166bc5de094","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ 见 [[29-df-bool-const]]；$\\star\\notin\\mathbb B$ 是固定的额外符号。$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$r\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\star\\notin\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B^J","display":false},{"tex":"J\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\to\\mathbb B\\cup\\{\\star\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb B^{\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}}\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"y:\\rho^{-1}(\\{\\star\\})\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"J\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a:J\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ext}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat a_n","display":false},{"tex":"f\\!\\upharpoonright\\!\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"V_n\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid1\\leq i\\leq n\\},\\qquad\\mathcal R_n\\coloneqq(\\mathbb B\\cup\\{\\star\\})^{V_n}.","display":true},{"tex":"U_n(\\rho)\\coloneqq\\rho^{-1}(\\{\\star\\}),\\qquad\\mathcal R_n^r\\coloneqq\\{\\rho\\in\\mathcal R_n\\mid|U_n(\\rho)|=r\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ext}_n(\\rho,y)\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n},\\qquad\\operatorname{Ext}_n(\\rho,y)(i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}y(i),&i\\in U_n(\\rho),\\\\\\rho(i),&i\\in V_n\\setminus U_n(\\rho).\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"f\\!\\upharpoonright\\!\\rho:\\mathbb B^{U_n(\\rho)}\\to\\mathbb B,\\qquad(f\\!\\upharpoonright\\!\\rho)(y)\\coloneqq f(\\operatorname{Ext}_n(\\rho,y)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat a_n\\in\\mathcal R_n,\\qquad\\widehat a_n(i)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a(i),&i\\in J,\\\\\\star,&i\\in V_n\\setminus J.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"V_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\star","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"V_n","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"V_n=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathcal R_n^r|=\\binom nr2^{n-r}","display":false}],"bytes":2496,"backlinks":[{"id":"d96a123476b0bcd3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathsf{DNF}_n,\\mathsf{Term}_n,R_n,b_n$ 见 [[29-df-ordered-dnf]]；$V_n,\\mathbb B,\\widehat a_n$ 见 [[29-df-boolean-restriction]]。$F\\in\\mathsf{DNF}_n$，$C\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n$，$x\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n}$。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-boolean-restriction]]、[[29-df-canonical-decision-tree]]、[[29-df-ordered-dnf]]、[[29-lem-hastad-switching]]、[[29-thm-parity-ac0]] — 随机限制、DNF 规范树、切换引理及非一致 AC⁰ 奇偶性下界"},{"id":"e376b5c876ef4c86","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathbb B,V_n,\\mathcal R_n,U_n(\\rho)$ 见 [[29-df-boolean-restriction]]。$\\rho\\in\\mathcal R_n$，$x\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n}$。"},{"id":"d7ed38c661c35e87","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal R_n^r$ 是恰有 $r$ 个自由变量的全部限制，见 [[29-df-boolean-restriction]]；$T_n$ 和 $h_n$ 是 [[29-df-canonical-decision-tree]] 的完整块查询树与边数高度。概率取有限集合 $\\mathcal R_n^r$ 上的均匀分布，不采用各坐标独立留空的另一分布。"},{"id":"0e17b36c42abaf3a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb B,V_n$ 见 [[29-df-boolean-restriction]]。$n\\geq1$，$w\\in\\mathbb B^{V_n}$，$\\langle w(i)\\rangle_{i=1}^n$ 是按递增输入编号排列的长度 $n$ 布尔串。$\\mathsf{PAR}_n(w)\\in\\mathbb B$ 在下式定义。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-boolean-restriction]]"}],"outgoing":["b9525166bc5de094"]}